    "transcript": "So I would split it into an ingestion pipeline and a query pipeline. On ingestion I chunk along the document structure, headings and sections, so a fact does not get cut in half. At query time I run both keyword search and vector search, because product names match lexically but paraphrased questions need embeddings. Then a reranker takes the top fifty down to maybe eight chunks before the model sees them. I would log ingestion and querying separately too. If answers were wrong I would look at the prompt first and then try a bigger model.",
